{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>打卡野餐主題!萌樣漢堡+焦糖布甸</p><p>Terrace in seaside布丁狗主題店！</p><p>Sanrio人氣角色布丁狗登陸韓食餐廳Terrace in seaside又一城分店，推出期間限定主題餐點！由即日起至年11月30日，餐廳從牆身到餐桌擺設都會見到布丁狗的可愛身影，另外仲有多款獨家限量聯乘精品，Fans要去！</p><p>兩款期間限定布丁狗主題套餐</p><p>Terrace in seaside又一城分店將推出兩款期間限定主題套餐，包括「布丁狗懶洋洋漢堡套餐」及「布丁狗慵懶秋日窩夫套餐」，融入布丁狗的可愛造型元素；飲品方面，套餐搭配濃郁朱古力奶，面層更有布丁狗可愛圖案，賣相超吸引！</p><p>獨家限量布丁狗精品輪流登場</p><p>粉絲亦可選購獨家推出的布丁狗限量聯乘精品，包括貼紙、杯墊、布甸杯、鎖匙扣及暖暖毛毯，惠顧一個套餐只限加購每款聯乘精品各一件，數量有限，先到先得，換完即止。相關精品將由即日起及10月14日起分階段登場，粉絲必入手！</p><p>Pompompurin．Terrace in seaside秋日療癒時光 限定主題餐廳 地址：九龍塘達之路80號又一城LG2樓LG2-26號舖 供應日期：即日至2026年11月30日，上午11時30分至晚上10時 官方IG：@terrace.in.seaside.hk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179057523927055444_10633500946aba02879cdf0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179057524160359182_13310870026aba028a55690.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179057524481019668_3339468976aba028d2986c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179057524669799741_1156305976aba028f48217.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17905752499575023_17782996386aba02923d4ad.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179057525154548074_15827158596aba0293d4170.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17905752532134545_12909038466aba0295af740.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179057525587179015_10049326366aba02989c549.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179057525914398022_17327738966aba029b7684c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T06:18:22.337521+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":616,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}